    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "10ceacd459293fe677cca107b1a01eb6379e6af654a89abf5b02b0e1ccdb6dc2",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 8,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "貴殿の処刑は神が決めたこと。\n四獣神の力を、人の子ごときが自由に行使していいはずがない。",
      "jp_sha256": "a92cd13710c3d13f71a4d0b9efd362e6d01e29b652ffe35be6a8b3e9792e6ba1",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "그대를 처형하는 건 신께서 정하신 일.\n사수신의 힘을 인간의 아이 따위가 자유롭게 행사해도 될 리 없다.",
      "message_index_0based": 8,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 18,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b012-20261109-same-model-pass2-aaabc0ee",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "1c596b41b2f05ff853a7780fb45346c0863a06c6befeeacf4ec35f0cdc946e5f:000000_-7733086095344765161:g0:r17",
      "row_index_0based": 17,
      "serialized_row_index": 17,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "オシュネー",
        "Emt1_Nor",
        "layer_中",
        "",
        "",
        "0.3",
        "",
        "貴殿の処刑は神が決めたこと。\n四獣神の力を、人の子ごときが自由に行使していいはずがない。",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        ""
      ],
      "speaker": "オシュネー",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "4446cdbdf2b55d1442b7381ed3eaee640256f691fa57c3a5b1220edd2e8558aa",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 9,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "神は言っている――。\n「貴殿らはここで死ぬ運命である」と。",
      "jp_sha256": "2bc4677fa025d98ee8ca2a599d2790f59bb5e6b470043094636680a81ec4967b",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "신께서는 말씀하신다――.\n『그대들은 여기서 죽을 운명이다』라고.",
      "message_index_0based": 9,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 19,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b012-20261109-same-model-pass2-aaabc0ee",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "1c596b41b2f05ff853a7780fb45346c0863a06c6befeeacf4ec35f0cdc946e5f:000000_-7733086095344765161:g0:r18",
      "row_index_0based": 18,
      "serialized_row_index": 18,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "オシュネー",
        "Emt1_Nor",
        "layer_中",
        "",
        "",
        "0.3",
        "",
        "神は言っている――。\n「貴殿らはここで死ぬ運命である」と。",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        ""
      ],
      "speaker": "オシュネー",
